>Davison</surname><given-names>BH</given-names></name><name><surname>Keller</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Integrating Engineering Design Improvements with Exoelectrogen Enrichment Process to Increase Power Output from Microbial Fuel Cells</article-title><source>J Power Sources</source><year>2009</year><comment></comment><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.jpowsour.2009.02.006</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Borole</surname><given-names>AP</given-names></name><name><surname>LaBarge</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Spott</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Three-dimensional, gas-phase fuel cells with a laccase biocathode</article-title><source>Journal of Power Sources</source><year>2009</year><volume>188</volume><fpage>421</fpage><lpage>426</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.jpowsour.2008.11.110</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>HaoYu</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Cheng</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Scott</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Logan</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Microbial fuel cell performance with non-Pt cathode catalysts</article-title><source>Journal of Power Sources</source><year>2007</year><volume>171</volume><fpage>275</fpage><lpage>281</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.jpowsour.2007.07.010</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Clauwaert</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Ha</surname><given-names>D Van der</given-names></name><name><surname>Boon</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surnam